 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, a student has been asked to construct a spanning tree for Graph <i>O</i>, as shown in the figure. The dashed lines show the first step that the student took, creating a path from vertex <i>c</i> to vertex <i>h</i>.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/221f04fed98ecf43.png\" alt=\"Graph O has eight vertices labeled from a to h. The edges are as follows: a f, a e, g f, g e, g h, h e, e f, f b, b c, f c, c d, f d, and d e. The edges, g f, g e, e h, and f c are in dashed lines.\">\n",
 "questions": [
